      "privacy": {
        "controller_title": "Data controller",
        "controller_text": "Nuvel is an online store run from Venezuela that sells to customers in any country in the world. When the buyer resides in the European Union, we process their data in accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR, EU Regulation 2016/679), even though we are not established in the Union. For buyers from other countries, we apply these same data protection standards as a minimum.",
